# The mobile-suit content pack (weapons, shields, armory, arena/space maps,
# liveries) — game content lives OUTSIDE the repo; canonical home is
# lite-template/integration/archive-mobile-suit/. The substrate reaches it only
# through guarded seams (extraction.plan.md). Never committed.
#
# Exceptions: two import-free *behavior* modules the general controllable engine
# depends on directly (dodge/tackle maneuvers + the AI opponent brain). They carry
# tracked test coverage in controllable-world.test.js and must resolve on a clean
# checkout — behavior, not content — so they are tracked while the rest of the
# pack stays out. See controllable/compose.js EMISSION.
lib/graph/mobile-suit/*
!lib/graph/mobile-suit/ms-maneuvers.js
!lib/graph/mobile-suit/ms-ai.js
